## gate 7: PASS -- rehearsal: a new database was replicated WITHOUT restarting litestream, via the control socket
route (a) config edit + litestream start: FAILED -- Error: start failed: database not found: /tmp/dg-sandbox-pdwqY6/rehearsal/data/rehearsal_two.sqlite
